- @outside_corporations
- @big_3
- @local_wealthy
- @cooperatives

@outside_corporations
title: Outside corporation suppliers
on-arrival: contract_outside += 1

We steer contracts toward offstation suppliers with no permanent Mikasa footprint.  The Big 3 are a little annoyed but would be much angrier if they realized this lets us cultivate outside relationships that could be used against them one day.

@big_3
title: Big Three suppliers

Community Soylent, Magrail Combine, and Brazos Zaibatsu all want the paperwork routed their way.  We can split the award across the neutral Docks hub — calming everyone a little — or concentrate work in one corp's home district and make a real friend there.

- @big_3_docks: Split contracts through the Docks hub
- @big_3_vats: Concentrate in the Vats (Community Soylent)
- @big_3_railyard: Concentrate in the Railyard (Magrail Combine)
- @big_3_limelight: Concentrate in the Limelight (Brazos Zaibatsu)

@big_3_docks
title: Split contracts through the Docks hub
subtitle: Spread the work; lower antagonism with all three megacorps
on-arrival: {!
contract_big3_docks = 1;
soylent_reprisal = Math.max(0, (Number(Q.soylent_reprisal) || 0) - 1);
magrail_reprisal = Math.max(0, (Number(Q.magrail_reprisal) || 0) - 1);
brazos_reprisal = Math.max(0, (Number(Q.brazos_reprisal) || 0) - 1);
if (typeof Q.addAsset === 'function') {
    Q.addAsset({ id: 'docks_big3_contract_hub', name: 'Docks trilateral contract hub', district: 'Docks', ownerType: 'public', owner: 'city', kind: 'office', major: false });
}
if (typeof Q.bumpDistrictProsperity === 'function') { Q.bumpDistrictProsperity('Docks', 0.06); }
if (typeof Q.syncIgAttitudes === 'function') { Q.syncIgAttitudes(); }
!}

Longshore clerks in the Docks process a three-way split.  None of the megacorps are thrilled, but none can claim we played favorites.  Trade clerks and corporate drones both see a little more steady work.

@big_3_vats
title: Concentrate in the Vats
subtitle: Favor Community Soylent; antagonize Magrail and Brazos
on-arrival: {!
contract_big3_vats = 1;
Q.soylent_leverage = (Number(Q.soylent_leverage) || 0) + 1;
Q.magrail_reprisal = (Number(Q.magrail_reprisal) || 0) + 1;
Q.brazos_reprisal = (Number(Q.brazos_reprisal) || 0) + 1;
if (typeof Q.addAsset === 'function') {
    Q.addAsset({ id: 'vats_soylent_contract_yard', name: 'Soylent municipal contract yard', district: 'Vats', ownerType: 'ig', owner: 'Soylent', kind: 'factory', major: false });
}
if (typeof Q.bumpDistrictProsperity === 'function') { Q.bumpDistrictProsperity('Vats', 0.08); }
if (typeof Q.syncIgAttitudes === 'function') { Q.syncIgAttitudes(); }
!}

Soylent compound managers take victory laps while rival corp liaisons file angry protests.  Vats employment ticks up; drone households tied to Soylent notice the difference first.

@big_3_railyard
title: Concentrate in the Railyard
subtitle: Favor Magrail Combine; antagonize Soylent and Brazos
on-arrival: {!
contract_big3_railyard = 1;
Q.magrail_leverage = (Number(Q.magrail_leverage) || 0) + 1;
Q.soylent_reprisal = (Number(Q.soylent_reprisal) || 0) + 1;
Q.brazos_reprisal = (Number(Q.brazos_reprisal) || 0) + 1;
if (typeof Q.addAsset === 'function') {
    Q.addAsset({ id: 'railyard_magrail_contract_depot', name: 'Magrail municipal contract depot', district: 'Railyard', ownerType: 'ig', owner: 'Magrail', kind: 'factory', major: false });
}
if (typeof Q.bumpDistrictProsperity === 'function') { Q.bumpDistrictProsperity('Railyard', 0.08); }
if (typeof Q.syncIgAttitudes === 'function') { Q.syncIgAttitudes(); }
!}

Magrail foremen expand shift schedules; Soylent and Brazos quietly route their complaints through syndicate channels.  The Railyard hums with freight-adjacent contract labor.

@big_3_limelight
title: Concentrate in the Limelight
subtitle: Favor Brazos Zaibatsu; antagonize Soylent and Magrail
on-arrival: {!
contract_big3_limelight = 1;
Q.brazos_leverage = (Number(Q.brazos_leverage) || 0) + 1;
Q.soylent_reprisal = (Number(Q.soylent_reprisal) || 0) + 1;
Q.magrail_reprisal = (Number(Q.magrail_reprisal) || 0) + 1;
if (typeof Q.addAsset === 'function') {
    Q.addAsset({ id: 'limelight_brazos_contract_studio', name: 'Brazos municipal contract studio', district: 'Limelight', ownerType: 'ig', owner: 'Brazos', kind: 'factory', major: false });
}
if (typeof Q.bumpDistrictProsperity === 'function') { Q.bumpDistrictProsperity('Limelight', 0.08); }
if (typeof Q.syncIgAttitudes === 'function') { Q.syncIgAttitudes(); }
!}

Brazos showcase halls pick up maintenance and fit-out work.  The other two megacorps treat the award as a deliberate snub — useful leverage if we meant to pick a side.

@local_wealthy
title: Local wealthy contractors

Shareholder-adjacent workshops and Docks rentiers both bid for the same municipal line items.  Either cluster works; the city's moneyed strata gossip about the award no matter which district hosts the signing ceremony.

- @wealthy_docks: Award through Docks firms
- @wealthy_aurora: Award through Aurora firms

@wealthy_docks
title: Award through Docks firms
subtitle: Prosperity in the Docks; shareholders citywide take notice
on-arrival: {!
contract_wealthy_docks = 1;
Q.rich_bump = 0.05;
if (typeof Q.addAsset === 'function') {
    Q.addAsset({ id: 'docks_wealthy_contract_office', name: 'Docks shareholder contract office', district: 'Docks', ownerType: 'stratum', owner: 'rich', kind: 'office', major: false });
}
if (typeof Q.applyStratumProsperityBumps === 'function') { Q.applyStratumProsperityBumps(); }
if (typeof Q.bumpDistrictProsperity === 'function') { Q.bumpDistrictProsperity('Docks', 0.05); }
!}

Docks shareholders pocket the prime subcontracts while their cousins in other districts still benefit from the spending ripple.  The old money crowd approves of government that pays on time.

@wealthy_aurora
title: Award through Aurora firms
subtitle: Prosperity in Aurora; shareholders citywide take notice
on-arrival: {!
contract_wealthy_aurora = 1;
Q.rich_bump = 0.05;
if (typeof Q.applyStratumProsperityBumps === 'function') { Q.applyStratumProsperityBumps(); }
if (typeof Q.bumpDistrictProsperity === 'function') { Q.bumpDistrictProsperity('Aurora', 0.05); }
!}

Aurora's boutique fabricators and logistics brokers land the contracts.  Wealthy households across Mikasa still feel the downstream orders — and remember who signed the checks.

@cooperatives
title: Local cooperatives and guilds

Cooperative workshops and guild ateliers can absorb small-batch municipal orders if we place the work where they already live.  Every site gives the local guilds a little more clout citywide.

- @coop_aurora: Aurora cooperatives
- @coop_pitts: Pitts cooperatives and Seven Families workshops
- @coop_deeps: Deeps cooperatives
- @coop_docks: Docks cooperatives and longshore guilds

@coop_aurora
title: Aurora cooperatives
on-arrival: {!
contract_coop_aurora = 1;
if (typeof Q.bumpDistrictProsperity === 'function') { Q.bumpDistrictProsperity('Aurora', 0.06); }
!}

Aurora coop yards pick up fabrication and life-support maintenance orders.  Guild brokers in other districts note that municipal business is no longer reserved for megacorp vendors.

@coop_pitts
title: Pitts cooperatives and guild workshops
on-arrival: {!
contract_coop_pitts = 1;
Q.families_leverage = (Number(Q.families_leverage) || 0) + 1;
if (typeof Q.bumpDistrictProsperity === 'function') { Q.bumpDistrictProsperity('Pitts', 0.07); }
if (typeof Q.syncIgAttitudes === 'function') { Q.syncIgAttitudes(); }
!}

Pitts cooperative machine shops and syndicate-tolerant guild floors share the workload.  The Seven Families treat the contract as recognition; coop members treat it as proof the city can hire locally.

@coop_deeps
title: Deeps cooperatives
on-arrival: {!
contract_coop_deeps = 1;
if (typeof Q.bumpDistrictProsperity === 'function') { Q.bumpDistrictProsperity('Deeps', 0.06); }
!}

Deepers' insulated workshops take contracts on their own terms — sealed bids, air-gapped ledgers, no corp middleware.  The district's prosperity tick rises without much fanfare outside the Deeps.

@coop_docks
title: Docks cooperatives and longshore guilds
on-arrival: {!
contract_coop_docks = 1;
if (typeof Q.bumpDistrictProsperity === 'function') { Q.bumpDistrictProsperity('Docks', 0.05); }
!}

Longshore guild halls and Docks coop yards split harbor-adjacent orders.  Dockside prosperity inches up; guild fixers elsewhere file the precedent away for next quarter's negotiations.

